@startuml SEQ_09_MENGELOLA_RUBRIK
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-09: Mengelola Komponen Rubrik Penilaian

actor       "Admin / Asisten"          as User
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "KomponenRubrikController" as Controller
entity      "KomponenRubrik Model"     as Model
database    "komponen_rubrik"          as DB

== Lihat Daftar Komponen Rubrik ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka halaman tugas, tab "Rubrik Penilaian"
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}/rubrik
Controller -> Model    : Query komponen rubrik berdasarkan tugas
Model -> DB            : SELECT komponen_rubrik WHERE tugas_id = ?
DB --> Model           : Data komponen
Model --> Controller   : Data komponen
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar komponen
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan daftar komponen: nama, deskripsi, bobot (%)

== Tambah Komponen Rubrik ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Tambah Komponen", isi nama, deskripsi, bobot (%)
Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/tugas/{id}/rubrik {nama, deskripsi, bobot}
Controller -> Model    : Query total bobot saat ini
Model -> DB            : SELECT SUM(bobot) FROM komponen_rubrik WHERE tugas_id = ?
DB --> Model           : Total bobot saat ini
Model --> Controller   : Total bobot saat ini
alt Total bobot melebihi 100%
  Controller --> Browser : Pesan error total bobot melebihi 100%
  Browser --> User       : Tampil pesan error
else Total masih <= 100%
  Controller -> Model : create({tugas_id, nama, deskripsi, bobot})
  Model -> DB         : INSERT INTO komponen_rubrik
  DB --> Model        : Berhasil
  Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
  Browser    --> User    : Komponen baru muncul di daftar
end

== Edit Komponen Rubrik ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Edit" pada komponen
Browser ->  Controller : PUT /praktikum/rubrik/{id} {nama, deskripsi, bobot}
Controller -> Model    : Query total bobot komponen lain
Model -> DB            : SELECT SUM(bobot) FROM komponen_rubrik WHERE tugas_id = ? AND id != {id}
DB --> Model           : Total bobot lain
Model --> Controller   : Total bobot lain
alt Total melebihi 100%
  Controller --> Browser : Pesan error total bobot melebihi 100%
  Browser --> User       : Tampil pesan error
else Total <= 100%
  Controller -> Model : update({nama, deskripsi, bobot})
  Model -> DB         : UPDATE komponen_rubrik SET ... WHERE id = {id}
  DB --> Model        : Berhasil
  Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
  Browser --> User    : Tampil notifikasi sukses
end

== Hapus Komponen Rubrik ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Hapus", konfirmasi
Browser ->  Controller : DELETE /praktikum/rubrik/{id}
Controller -> Model    : delete()
Model -> DB            : DELETE FROM komponen_rubrik WHERE id = {id}
DB --> Model           : Berhasil
Model --> Controller   : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Tampil notifikasi sukses

== Atur Urutan Komponen (Drag-and-Drop) ==

User    ->  Browser    : Drag-and-drop untuk reorder komponen
Browser ->  Controller : PUT /praktikum/tugas/{id}/rubrik/urutan {items: [{id, urutan}, ...]}
Controller -> Model    : update({urutan}) per item
Model -> DB            : UPDATE komponen_rubrik SET urutan = ? WHERE id = ?
DB --> Model           : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Daftar rubrik terupdate urutan

== Nilai Tambahan (Bonus / Penalty) ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka tab "Nilai Tambahan" pada tugas
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}/nilai-tambahan
Controller -> DB       : SELECT nilai_tambahan WHERE tugas_id = ?
DB --> Controller      : Data nilai tambahan
Controller --> Browser : Data nilai tambahan
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan tabel nilai tambahan

User    ->  Browser    : Tambah / edit nilai tambahan
Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/tugas/{id}/nilai-tambahan {praktikan_id, nilai, catatan}
Controller -> DB       : INSERT INTO nilai_tambahan atau UPDATE SET ... WHERE tugas_id = ?
DB --> Controller      : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> User       : Tampil notifikasi sukses

@enduml
